The files in this directory are three.js r160, vendored unmodified:

  three.module.js      the core library
  MTLLoader.js         addons/loaders/MTLLoader.js
  RoomEnvironment.js   addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js

Vendored rather than loaded from a CDN so the sequence has no third-party
runtime dependency and cannot break because someone else's host did.

three.js is MIT licensed. Its licence follows in full; it is not the licence
of the rest of this repository.

